OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners welcome rail bridge
OL,4,Amaintenance switch
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have welcomed plans to take
OL,7,Fthe management of 3,000 railway
OL,8,Fbridges, tunnels and viaducts away from
OL,9,Fa government department accused of
OL,10,F"cultural vandalism".
OL,12,FNational Highways and its forerunner
OL,13,Fthe Highways Agency have had oversight
OL,14,Fof what is known as the Historic
OL,15,FRailways Estate since 2013, but control
OL,16,Fis to be given to new state body Great
OL,17,FBritish Railways (GBR).
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
