OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners welcome rail bridge
OL,4,Amaintenance switch
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn alliance of campaigners called the
OL,7,FHRE Group has been critical of National
OL,8,FHighways' efforts, which included an
OL,9,Farch near Brough, in Cumbria, being
OL,10,Ffilled with tonnes of concrete in 2021.
OL,12,FThis week, Rail Minister Lord Hendy
OL,13,Fsaid GBR would have "the capability,
OL,14,Fknowledge and experience to maintain
OL,15,Fthe estate".
